            <ArticleTitle>Cryotherapy for headache.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>598-600</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>45 patients with migraine or migraine plus chronic daily headache evaluated the effectiveness of a coldwrap for headache relief. 35.5% judged it not effective, 29% judged it mildly effective, 26.5% found it moderately effective, and 9% judged it completely effective. Previous studies on ice treatment for headache are reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
